# Technology Standards

- Prefer Astro-first patterns and keep components mostly declarative.
- Use Tailwind utility classes for styling by default, use `cn` utility helper function to merge styles.
- Minimize custom JS logic; only add behavior required for UX.
- Avoid over-engineering: pick the simplest solution that satisfies the requirement.
- Keep components small and reusable (extract shared UI pieces when repeated).
- Prefer composition over complex abstractions.
